Subject: [PATCH] lib/crc7: Shift crc7() output left 1 bit
Cc: arik@wizery.com, coelho@ti.com, david.gnedt@davizone.at, eliad@wizery.com,
        laurent.pinchart+renesas@ideasonboard.com, linux@horizon.com,
